+#     answering a question nobody will read — the verdict that matters is the
+#     one at the current head — and on a saturated runner pool those superseded
+#     runs are the ones the head's own run is queued behind.
+# Conditioning the flag on the event keeps the writer uncancellable and drops
+# only the runs whose answer is already stale.
